commit 5eb5cb926970bd433778dde5cfd9725a08f31373
Author: Claude <<redacted>>
Date:   Sat Oct 31 18:13:34 2026 +0000

    Add a Finish bag button to the bag page

    One tap on the coffee page of an open bag finishes it: POST
    /api/bags/{bag_id}/finish writes a new bags record with finished_on set
    (the phone's date), like a retraction, never a delete or an edit of an
    existing lake file. Finishing a finished bag writes nothing, so an
    outbox resend is harmless. A finished bag leaves Today and the bag
    pickers (Switch coffee, the bag list when correcting a shot) and stays
    in Coffees, marked finished. The write goes through the outbox, so it
    also works offline; once delivered it clears the kept Today and Log
    shot pages and the phone's selected bag if it was this one.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <<redacted>>

